    "appVersionLoginNote" : {
      "comment" : "iPhone and iPad, account sheet: the app's name and version at the bottom, with a note on privacy. 'Issues' is the app's name; %(version)@ is its version, e.g. '1.2'. Keep api.github.com as it is.",
