    "dueDatePlaceholder" : {
      "comment" : "Mac: placeholder in the search field of the due date picker. The quoted examples are things the field understands; it reads English and the app's language, so use this language's own words (see DateWords in Model/CalendarDay.swift), e.g. German „fr“ or „12.10.“.",
